## Setup and checks

```sh
scripts/jig setup
scripts/jig check fmt
scripts/jig check clippy
scripts/jig check test
scripts/jig check test-locked
scripts/jig check contract
```

Setup creates `Cargo.lock`; commit it so locked checks and CI use the same dependency resolution.
