Add future crates beneath `crates/` and list each one explicitly in the root workspace members. Give a new direct-child crate its own `AGENTS.md` when it gains meaningful ownership or invariants.

The root manifest, this README, the seed crate manifest, guide, and Rust source are scaffolded once and then owned by this project. `jig update` maintains the Jig harness but does not rewrite them.

The seed package starts with `publish = false` and no `license` or `license-file`. Choose the correct license and publication metadata deliberately before changing that policy.

